 range and falloff\n- Trajectory visualizer added to jump pads \n- Flashlight volumetric fog light scattering cone\n\nOther:\n- new music\n- team based damage filter support\n- modular scoreboard\n- team based scoreboard support\n- significant shader global complexity reduction\n- improvements to cpu load distribution per frame\n- far more optimized skeletal meshes\n- shader permutation reduction\n- increased teller parallelization\n- optimizations to dungeon\n- improvements to dungeon doors\n- fix to player collisions with some skeletal meshes\n- fix to some objects being invisible far from spawn\n- teller network optimizations\n- large player network optimizations\n- other player spawn performance improvement\n- performance stats tweaks\n- visual fixes to last man standing\n- optimizations to heavily populated levels like hq\n- memory optimizations\n- fix to possible stale teller render when moving\n- fix to rare invisible teller issue\n- fix to tellers sometimes sending info before local player booted\n- smoother mag insert physics and visuals\n- some fixes to gun mag insert\n- init tweaks\n- fix to show usernames false not always working\n- fix to player ragdoll stutter right before despawn\n- fix to items have collision when player die with them in inventory\n- fix to item collisions after player quickly take out of inventory\n- fix to rare crash with loading two mags at once\n- fix to attachable object ownership check\n- fix to npc walking stutter\n- fix to username culled visibility\n- fix to sometimes car stutter\n- relative ground performance increase\n- android mvl early work\n- pcvr mvl early work\n- hand tracker performance increase\n- hand tracker rare issue fix\n- fix to collisions sometimes not being enabled between placed items and vehicle interior\n- gun gun kills now count towards kill count\n- fix to gun gun damage in friendly mode\n- fix to healing staff getting stuck healing when player dies or slots it in inventory\n- parallelization improvemen